      │  └─ plotScenarioAndDetections.m
      ├─ +results/
      ├─ +scenario/
      │  └─ createScenario.m
      └─ +tracking/
         ├─ buildTracker.m
         ├─ initCVFilter.m
         ├─ initIMMFilter.m
         └─ runTracker.m
```

#### Root Folder Purpose

- `config/`: Parameterized JSON configs for defaults, scenarios, and trackers.
- `data/`: Dataset-style artifacts (detections/results) intended for local runs.
- `results/`: Timestamped output `.mat` files from scenario executions.
- `scripts/`: User entry points for running workflows.
- `src/`: MATLAB package code (`+trackbench`) split by responsibility.

#### Planned/Target Package Layout (Proposed)

This is the intended package structure for the `+rainyday` refactor:

```text
src/+rainyday/
├─ +core/
│  └─ runExperiment.m              % SINGLE-RUN ENGINE (the heart)
│
├─ +loader/
│  ├─ ingestConfig.m               % Stage 1: Read & merge configs
│  ├─ validateConfig.m             % Stage 2: Check required fields/types
│  ├─ normalizeConfig.m            % Stage 3: Units/coords/time
│  └─ expandRunPlan.m              % Stage 4: Sweep -> run list
│
├─ +orchestrator/
│  ├─ runSingle.m                  % Wrapper: loader -> engine -> results
│  ├─ runBatch.m                   % Loop over run plan
│  └─ runParallel.m                % Parallel execution (Phase 3+)
│
├─ +results/
│  ├─ ResultsSchema.m              % Define standard results struct
│  ├─ saveResults.m                % Persist to disk/database
│  └─ loadResults.m                % Reload for analysis
│
└─ +reporting/                     % Outside the engine
   ├─ generatePlots.m
   ├─ generateReport.m
   └─ compareRuns.m

scripts/
├─ runSingleScenario.m             % Entry: single run
├─ runParameterSweep.m             % Entry: batch sweep
└─ analyzeResults.m                % Entry: post-processing
```

